WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.210
Buffalo Bull's Back Fat was head chief
of the Blood, or Kainai, people,

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.050
part of the Blackfoot Confederacy.

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.630
Catlin painted him in 1832 at Fort Union,

4
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.470
a fur-trading post
on the upper Missouri River.

5
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.630
Take in the detail: the long hair,

6
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.710
the hide shirt decorated with quillwork
and paint, the long pipe.

7
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.850
It is a powerful image of a powerful man.

8
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.770
Now notice what's missing.

9
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.830
There is no hint
of the fur trade, the fort,

10
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.450
or the diplomacy happening all around him.
